{"id":"fb1d19fa40d8e799","group":"72","path":"72/meta/revision-2026-10-22.md","title":"旧轮次报告缺失说明","display":"旧轮次报告缺失说明","type":"report","metadata":{"type":"report","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-missing-historical-report-2026-10-22","aliases":["72-missing-historical-report-2026-10-22"],"verification_status":"historical-report-not-recovered","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"report"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-missing-historical-report-2026-10-22"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-missing-historical-report-2026-10-22</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"historical-report-not-recovered"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<p>本轮开始时，本路径不存在，但既有导航共有12处链接指向它。保留在各导航中的“339→389、新增50、修订49”等数字属于先前轮次的文字记录；其原报告及相应差异证据未取得，不能由本页补造或追认。</p>\n<p>本页仅恢复链接目标并明确历史缺口。当前实际以389个原子为基线的扩充、修订与验证，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"57199c40d155f4ba\" href=\"?note=57199c40d155f4ba\" title=\"revision-2026-10-22-expansion\">revision-2026-10-22-expansion</a>。本页不是数学原子，也不是旧轮次核验通过的证明。</p>\n","headings":[],"links":[{"target":"revision-2026-10-22-expansion","status":"resolved","id":"57199c40d155f4ba","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"","excerpt":"本页仅恢复链接目标并明确历史缺口。当前实际以389个原子为基线的扩充、修订与验证，见 [[revision-2026-10-22-expansion]]。本页不是数学原子，也不是旧轮次核验通过的证明。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[],"bytes":809,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-474","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"2026-10-22：本轮新增原子按来源主题进入对应章节；形式登记仍保留原有三个X章元目录节点，另两个元目录节点没有强行归入数学章节。新主题链接与本轮统计见 [[meta/revision-2026-10-22]]。"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-419","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"2026-10-22：当前登记为389个原子，其中384个内容原子、5个形式目录原子；